# Local Docker volume data (MySQL, Elasticsearch) - created at runtime
# Note: MySQL now uses the named volume `mysql-data` (see docker-compose.yml).
# Any docker-volume/db-data* dirs below are legacy / corrupt backups kept locally only.
docker-volume/db-data/
docker-volume/db-data*/
*.sql
*.err
# Local secrets (copy .env.example -> .env and fill it in)
.env